Z||000000||Bluebottlejunky||04-08-2001||08:40 PM||||Today at a taco bell with me and my freind in his fiero..a guy walked up to us and started trash talkin the fiero..last thing he says is that imports suck!?!?!???!!?!??!  What the h*** this guy dosen't know crap..I never new a Fiero was an import did u guys? hehe Go Pontiac!  What are some werid thing that people have said about your fieros?<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>85' GT 4sp||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jay||04-08-2001||10:05 PM||||Every time I tell people I own a Fiero, they all say the same thing..."Be careful those cars catch on fire!!".  Some people are so afraid they won't take a drive with me for fear of spontaneous cumbustion.  Their loss.  <P>Others are astonished when I tell them it is a 1986 Fiero GT.  They assume it is a newer car made in the 90's. "Great condition, no rust anywhere on the body!" In effect they are right.  Most of my car has 90's parts in it, and of coarse the body panels will not rust.  My car looks pretty stock from the outside and yet it has still been called a Ferrari, Maserati, Lamborghini even a supped up CRX of all things!  I love it.  The GT is so sexy!<P>1986 Fiero GT Northstar <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/jaygrande" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/jaygrande</A> <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
