Z||000003||Bluebottlejunky||04-08-2001||10:18 PM||||hehe ya never thought of that!<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>85' GT 4sp||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroJoe||04-08-2001||10:27 PM||||Nobody has ever bashed my fiero, yet, and hopefully not.  If someone dosent think the way I do about anything, it usually isnt worth arguing about if you can tell they are ignorant and cannot/willnot change thier mind.  So I usually dont bother.  Like if someone said "you're fiero is a piece of crap", all I would retort with is "and what are you driving, a rusty old cavy with a ghetto bent antenna?  Good job."<P>Ignorant people need to stop breeding.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||WKDFIRO||04-09-2001||01:46 AM||||Ive been with other people when their Fiero has been trashed on but Ive never had that happen to me. Ive had people compliment me and even had 1 person ask me if it was for sale (now that blew me away!)when Im with my Fiero. <P>Sometimes if I talk to people and tell them I have a Fiero they get that look. All I do is start it up (Cam and 2 1/2 inch exhaust) and people suddenly seem to have nice things to say...||||reg||12
Z||000006||Steve Normington||04-09-2001||03:46 PM||||When I told my "friend" that I had bought a Fiero, he asked me, "Why?"<P>I'd have quit hanging around with him, except he works for NAPA and can get me GM parts at cost. Plus, he'll look up parts for a 97/88/85 Olds/S-10/Fiero (that's one car).<P>------------------<BR>85 SE 2M6||||reg||12
